<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 318 0 R
/E (Current camouflage detection methods rely on heavy deep learning models that require high computational power and energy, making them impractical for deployment on low power edge devices used in military field operations. An ultra low power spiking neural network based approach is needed that can perform real time camouflage detection on resource constrained edge hardware while maintaining high accuracy.)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
