/S /P
/P 1368 0 R
/E (Energy Inefficiency: High-performance GPUs consume excessive wattage \(15W-30W+\), making them unsustainable for small, battery-powered military drones or micro-robots.)
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
659 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1369 0 R
/E (Static Frame Bottleneck: Conventional ANNs process every frame equally, wasting power on redundant background data instead of focusing on dynamic "spikes" of movement or texture changes.)
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [4]
>>
